secubox-aggregator (0.2.0-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Loader v2 (ref #498) : synthetic parent package sbx_pkg_<name>
    with __path__ → <name>/api, drops sys.modules['api*'] before and
    after each load. Fixes 9 of 11 previously-failing modules
    (crowdsec, eye-remote, haproxy, health-doctor, mail, modem, users,
    secubox-crowdsec, secubox-modem) ; relative imports + cross-module
    api shadow both handled.
  * Migration helper v2 (ref #498) : walks /etc/nginx/secubox.d/,
    /etc/nginx/secubox-routes.d/ AND sites-enabled/webui.conf inline
    blocks + /api/ catch-all. Preserves /api/v1/<name>/ prefix on
    every rewrite. Special-cases hub TCP 127.0.0.1:8001 → aggregator
    unix. Skips legacy secubox-* prefixed twin dirs.
  * Live numbers on gk2 : 119 of 121 modules mount, 3499 → 1984 MB
    RSS, free RAM 153 MB → 2.7 GiB.

